      ],
      "covers": [
        "TV safe margins"
      ],
      "score": 0.378,
      "guidance": "Keep interactive and text content ≥5% from edges: at the 960×540 dp design frame that is 48 dp horizontal and 27 dp vertical (Android guidance: up to 58/28 dp for maximum safety; tvOS: 60 pt sides, 60 pt top/bottom on the 1920×1080 frame). Let rails scroll under the margin so partial cards hint at more content.",
